    "name": {
      "value": "Warding Statuette"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This small figurine is carved from soapstone in the shape of a deity or guardian, facing both front and back to indicate unflagging vigilance. The spell attack roll of any spell cast by activating this item is +13.\n\n- - **Armor:** You gain resistance 1 against ranged weapon attacks.\n- - **Weapon:** When you hit with a Strike using the affixed weapon, or when a spell effect you created by activating the statuette hits with a Strike, you can choose a creature adjacent to the creature that was hit. That creature gains a +1 status bonus to AC until the start of your next turn. No more than one creature can benefit from this each turn.\n\nYou cast shield.\n\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou cast spiritual weapon."
    },
